-- StrataTactics — a tactical layer over any Strata world, as a plugin
-- (docs/plugins.md): a grid of tiles read from the voxels (StrataTactics.Grid
-- and the queries beside it), an FFT turn clock (StrataTactics.Clock) and an
-- XCOM-style camera (StrataTactics.Camera). It uses only Strata's public
-- modules.
mod StrataTactics do

  doc "The plugin's version."
  fn version() : String do "0.1.0" end
end
